#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""porta - the command line half of Portamento, a CrossOver-style launcher for Windows games on macOS.

Prefixes live in ~/Library/Application Support/Portamento/prefixes/<name>, each with
a porta.json that picks a Wine and a graphics backend. The runtime for a
backend is built on demand as an APFS clone of that Wine (no extra disk
space) with the backend's DLLs copied over Wine's own.
"""
